Instructions:


INSTALLATION:

(COMPLETE SCRATCH)
a)Go to the Chrome Extensions Store and install the extension 'Tampermonkey'
b)Download the main script
c)Create a new script in tampermonkey
d)Drag the file onto the open area



If it doesn't work in game:
a) You need to give tampermonkey all permissions to chrome.
b) If (a) didnt work, you might need to edit it (delete and re-type the same thing) and save.



